ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 26547, Sep. 25, 2015>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on September 28, 2015.
Article 2 (Special cases concerning standards for the assignment of librarians and standards for library materials)
(1) Where the number of librarians assigned at the time this Decree enters into force falls short of the standards for the assignment of librarians set forth in Appendix 1, the president of a university (limited to universities other than schools referred to in subparagraphs 5 through 7 of Article 2 of the Higher Education Act; hereinafter the same shall apply to this Article) may, notwithstanding Appendix 1, comply with the standards or scope prescribed by the Minister of Education until the applicable date specified in each of the following subparagraphs according to the classification therein:
1. Colleges referred to in subparagraph 4 of Article 2 of the Higher Education Act: September 28, 2018;
2. Universities other than those referred to in subparagraph 1: September 28, 2017.
(2) Where the number of library materials secured at the time this Decree enters into force falls short of the standards set forth in Appendix 2, the president of a university may, notwithstanding Appendix 2, comply with the standards or scope prescribed by the Minister of Education until the applicable date specified in each of the following subparagraphs according to the classification therein:
1. Colleges referred to in subparagraph 4 of Article 2 of the Higher Education Act: September 28, 2018;
2. Universities other than those referred to in subparagraph 1: September 28, 2017.
Article 3 (Special cases concerning education and training for librarians and professional staff)
With respect to education and training for librarians and professional staff conducted from the date this Decree enters into force until December 31, 2015, the president of a university may, notwithstanding Article 5 (2) and the relevant school regulations, comply with the standards or scope prescribed by the Minister of Education.

